5% of the 52-week high",true,"-8.2% vs high 104.03 (close)"],["RS rating 70 or higher (desk RS)",true,"RS 90"]],"tt_pass":true,"desk":{"setups":[{"k":"SEPA","status":"setup, risk too wide","pivot":100,"stop":84.17,"tf":null,"actionable":null,"date":null,"score":null,"pnl":{"state":"pending","side":"long","entry":100.0,"stop":84.17,"last":95.5,"last_date":"2026-10-02","to_entry_pct":4.71}}],"setups_asof":"2026-10-02","vsa":{"label":"SEPA","headline":"test 8 Sep (moderate, uptrend); Neutral 45","balance":"Neutral","score":45,"narrative":"Context now: uptrend (rising 50-day, lower highs and lower lows, +5% in 20 bars); price at new 20-bar highs; upthrust 28 Aug on 1.2x volume, closed on the low - but inside an uptrend with strength behind it an upthrust is 'in the wrong place', at resistance / new highs (low significance); effort to fall 28 Aug on 1.2x volume, closed on the low - but a wide down bar inside an uptrend: watch whether it is tested, at resistance / new highs (low significance); effort to fall 1 Sep on 1.2x volume, closed on the low - but a wide down bar inside an uptrend: watch whether it is tested (low significance); a test 8 Sep on volume 11% below average - a low-volume test with strength behind it: supply is drying up (moderate significance); a no-demand bar 24 Sep on volume 47% below average - but inside an uptrend - often just a pause on a pullback (lack of professional interest, not selling) (low significance); last 5 bars: up bars on heavier volume (1.0x vs 0.7x) = demand in control; latest 2 Oct: down bar on 0.67x volume, no VSA sign; balance neutral 45/100.","status":"setup, risk too wide","last_sign":{"name":"No demand","d":"2026-09-29","pol":-1,"sig":0.32,"tier":"low","why":"no demand in the range: no professional interest in higher prices yet","ref":null},"key_bars":[{"name":"Test","d":"2026-09-08","pol":1,"sig":1.27,"tier":"moderate"}],"asof":null},"scores":{"overall":64,"group":"SIC 737x (Business Services & Software)","group_rank":29,"group_n":216,"sector_rank":90,"sector_n":395,"ai_tag":"cloud/software","earn":49}},"biz":{"name":"JFrog Ltd","desc":"JFrog Ltd. provides software supply chain platform in the United States, Israel, India, and internationally. The company offers JFrog Artifactory, a package repository that allows teams and organizations to store, update, and manage software packages; JFrog Curation functions as a guardian outside the software development pipeline, controlling the admission of packages into an organization, from open source or public repositories; JFrog Xray, scans JFrog Artifactory to secure all software packages; JFrog Advanced Security, an optional add-on for select JFrog subscriptions; and JFrog Runtime Security, an optional add-on for select JFrog subscriptions to work with other JFrog Security solutions. It also provides JFrog ML, a platform-integrated solution designed for data science and MLOps teams to transform and store data, build, train, and deploy models, and monitor the entire Machine Learning pipeline; JFrog AI Catalog, an extension of JFrog Curation functionality that allows companies to secure, govern, consume and deploy AI technologies; JFrog AppTrust, an optional component with application risk governance of DevGovOps requirements; JFrog Distribution that provides software package distribution; and JFrog Connect, a device management solution that allows companies to manage software updates and monitor performance in IoT device fleets. In addition, the company offers JFrog Pro that provides access to the universal version of JFrog Artifactory and ongoing updates, upgrades, and bug fixes; JFrog Pro X, a self-managed-only subscription; JFrog Enterprise X, offers cluster configuration, federated repositories, multi-region replication, larger enterprise-scale deployments, service-level agreement support, and deeper security; and JFrog Enterprise Plus, a full platform subscription option. It serves technology, financial services, retail, healthcare, and telecommunications organizations. JFrog Ltd. was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Sunnyvale, California with additional office in Netanya, Israel.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"7372","sic_desc":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","mcap":10950388736,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"SUNNYVALE, CA","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1800667,"state_inc":"L3","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-06"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-09-29","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":88636000.0,"rev_yoy":23.1,"eps":-0.13,"eps_yoy":45.8,"ni":-13747000.0,"ni_yoy":41.6,"nm":-15.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":97260000.0,"rev_yoy":27.1,"eps":-0.1,"eps_yoy":56.5,"ni":-11233000.0,"ni_yoy":51.5,"nm":-11.5,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":100311000.0,"rev_yoy":25.7,"eps":-0.08,"eps_yoy":61.9,"ni":-8790000.0,"ni_yoy":57.8,"nm":-8.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":103043000.0,"rev_yoy":22.4,"eps":-0.13,"eps_yoy":13.3,"ni":-14303000.0,"ni_yoy":7.5,"nm":-13.9,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-30","rev":109056000.0,"rev_yoy":23.0,"eps":-0.21,"eps_yoy":-61.5,"ni":-22945000.0,"ni_yoy":-66.9,"nm":-21.0,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-12-31","rev":116078000.0,"rev_yoy":19.3,"eps":-0.21,"eps_yoy":-110.0,"ni":-23198000.0,"ni_yoy":-106.5,"nm":-20.0,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2025-03-31","rev":122407000.0,"rev_yoy":22.0,"eps":-0.16,"eps_yoy":-100.0,"ni":-18503000.0,"ni_yoy":-110.5,"nm":-15.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-06-30","rev":127220000.0,"rev_yoy":23.5,"eps":-0.19,"eps_yoy":-46.2,"ni":-21675000.0,"ni_yoy":-51.5,"nm":-17.0,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-09-30","rev":136907000.0,"rev_yoy":25.5,"eps":-0.14,"eps_yoy":